{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46651","headline":"荆州新秋病起杂题一十五首 病起见衰叶 · 齐己","name":"荆州新秋病起杂题一十五首 病起见衰叶","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"病起见衰叶，飘然似我身。\n偶乘风有韵，初落地无尘。\n纵得红沾露，争如绿带春。\n因伤此怀抱，聊寄一篇新。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46651.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46651","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}